                    "textStyle": {
                      "color": "#111111",
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Relief on 3.8% of complaints vs ~29\u201332% at peers, who mostly fix accounts and credit reports rather than refund.",
